#### never returns an empty error for any signal death

- Verify: never returns an empty error for any signal death


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: never returns an empty error for any signal death")
for code in [137, 139, 134, 143, 144]:
    val r = make_result_from_output("/tmp/no_such_spec.spl", "", "", code, 10, 60)
    assert_false(r.error == "")
```

